<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coventry Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coventry Corp raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer said it upgraded Coventry Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- cited strong management team which has taken steps to improve earnings and improve the medical loss ratio.</p>
<p>-- Coventry gained 1-1/16 to 16-1/8.</p>
</text>
